title: Guard telemetry metrics storage and readiness against unsupported filesystems
description: "The metrics service crashed after its TSDB volume resolved onto an unsupported filesystem. Recovery preserved all data and restored local POSIX storage, but deployment and storage relocation currently lack a preventive filesystem/readiness check."
